#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/quickstart.md:1 c90837da064a45d7b9837c304c05127b
msgid "Synthia quickstart"
msgstr "Synthia inicio rapido"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/quickstart.md:3 553630f2a7874d86b6698dea28074f42
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/quickstart.md:5 434a5f0a2bc54dab9d3ea04dc4245979
msgid ""
"Use a clean checkout, the runtime declared by the repository, and its "
"committed lockfiles. Confirm the active branch before installing anything."
msgstr ""
"Use una copia limpia, el runtime declarado por el repositorio y sus archivos"
" de bloqueo confirmados. Confirme la rama activa antes de instalar nada."

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/quickstart.md:11 7df8cb386b5b4ecbaf4566b3fd9e56cb
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Instalar"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/quickstart.md:18 a3320161d0124708b2dc722909ead36f
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Comenzar"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/quickstart.md:24 3a9a544a754741d890c55fd156ee9573
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verificar"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/quickstart.md:30 00c4adc61f204bf78f1aedc258c8135f
msgid "Human acceptance"
msgstr "Aceptacion humana"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/quickstart.md:32 5159aa5fdf2b46bfb5aa5cac3d1757c1
msgid ""
"Inspect the output, logs, test results, and diff. Accept, request a "
"correction, quarantine, or stop; do not silently promote a generated result."
msgstr ""
"Inspeccione la salida, los registros, los resultados de pruebas y el diff. "
"Acepte, solicite una correccion, ponga en cuarentena o detengase; no "
"promueva silenciosamente un resultado generado."
